//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Push/fold JAM ranges (effective stack <= ~10bb). Near-Nash, position-scaled.
//  At these depths strong broadways (KJ/QJ/KT/QT/JT) and any ace/pair are SHOVES,
//  not folds - folding them is the leak that blinds a short stack out. [Nash push]
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

